Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.78,0:00:11.41,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)\pos(1548,630)}The Guild Hall
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Guild Hall?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know about them?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.69,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard of them,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.95,0:00:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't realize there's one here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We try to avoid attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you don't know where to look,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.76,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the Guild tends to stay hidden. 
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your card.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is from Laojun.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.07,0:00:25.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.55,0:00:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It should help with your recovery.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.92,0:00:28.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.12,0:00:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I bring this back after I'm done?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.38,0:00:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessary.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have more than enough on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.61,0:00:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Laojun tell you anything?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.30,0:00:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is also a pass to every guild hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We offer services for all Elfin who visit us.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.14,0:00:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably don't know how the Guild operates now.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to explain?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.91,0:00:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have the time. 
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.86,0:00:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's part of my job.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.20,0:00:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild was founded by Laojun and two other deities.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one in each large human city.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.45,0:01:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We offer services for spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides acting as an inn, like in old times,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.56,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it also provides financial support for living in the human world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the catch?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.20,0:01:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.15,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow the Guild's rules.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.91,0:01:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the rules?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.81,0:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't slay your own kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.64,0:01:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't reveal yourself to humans.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're willing to work with us,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you can reap even more benefits.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.58,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna fight today, or not?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.89,0:01:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll keep my mouth shut!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.36,0:02:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our practice field.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones we just met.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They are frequent visitors.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't live in the city because of their appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.29,0:02:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they strong?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.94,0:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.75,0:02:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how come they can't take a human form?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All spirits have their true form.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about cultivation.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A human form is good only for blending in.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even those who can't transform can find an expert.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.60,0:02:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They simply think it's below them to look human.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.07,0:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the strongest between you guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.39,0:02:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say I'm the weakest.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how come you're the hall manager?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make money.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.58,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you make money?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.26,0:02:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I sell these trees.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.82,0:02:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The lush vegetation here is your work, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.67,0:02:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.71,0:02:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Trees born quickly from magic also die quickly.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the trees whose growth I stimulate,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.82,0:02:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,are capable of surviving.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are trees that expensive?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.60,0:02:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,High quality wood is extremely valuable.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.08,0:02:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially nowadays.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.62,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And moneymaking made you the boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.78,0:03:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.25,0:03:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go a floor up.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.57,0:03:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more floor?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.95,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand still.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.34,0:03:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the core of our hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.26,0:03:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see the location and data of every guild hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.94,0:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite the spectical.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.63,0:03:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better at places with more bandwidth.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.51,0:03:37.31,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Space fluctuations...?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.91,0:03:38.79,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,This isn't just a map, is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.05,0:03:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much more.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every dot on the map represents a guild hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.60,0:03:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides being a marker,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,each dot actually connects us to a hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.77,0:03:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying these are all space points?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.25,0:03:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.59,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is amazing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.29,0:03:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Qianzhen.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.56,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Manager!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.61,0:03:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing them around?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The others are waiting.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.24,0:04:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You should hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya later, little spirits!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people have a meet-up here.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't hate humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.27,0:04:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't tell who's human.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can use this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't there troublemakers?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.72,0:04:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see us over there.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.25,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The color of the upper dot shows the type of the hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.37,0:04:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours is gold, as we do mainly commerce.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.49,0:04:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The dots below stand for the resident spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.84,0:04:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's three of us here, including Tu Bei and me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But also human assistants work in every hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How do others offer support if they can't earn money?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Resources are shared among halls.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like capital, space, military force,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.54,0:04:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,magic weapons and tools.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.04,0:04:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The hall manager can use them within their discretion.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.92,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If there are humans here,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.46,0:04:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,why is it a rule that you can't reveal yourself to humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Many humans already know about our existence.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you, a confidant of Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.51,0:04:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But not every human can tolerate us.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.59,0:05:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was better back then,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.77,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but since humans have gotten stronger, we've run into trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After a few incidents, we established the current rules.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.23,0:05:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best way to get along for now.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.58,0:05:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.93,0:05:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to earn money in the first place?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just create gold or money?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It would wreck up the human financial world.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.03,0:05:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In the long run, it's best to follow their rules.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I should open an ice warehouse.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.07,0:05:27.67,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna steal.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.89,0:05:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not making money...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.84,0:05:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you could do express deliveries.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.26,0:05:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.93,0:05:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done with the introduction.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to go into more detail?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.46,0:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for now.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.82,0:05:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's grab some tea.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you stay for lunch?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.65,0:05:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my grandfather is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.89,0:05:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.14,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.18,0:06:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.26,0:06:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to accept it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.39,0:06:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Laojun.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you promise anime merch to him?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.54,0:06:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.18,0:06:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I take you to Shanxin's?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.61,0:06:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to an anime con tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to head back and help fix the shrine.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in a couple days.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.74,0:06:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know I'm here?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was about to head over.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.30,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.19,0:06:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Gen.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.51,0:06:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.60,0:06:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I came for Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And Xiaohei, for Huang.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.79,0:06:52.67,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'd rather go home...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.29,0:06:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.47,0:06:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu and co. have left.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They went to the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.34,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They know how to behave.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.41,0:07:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They might be following Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.93,0:07:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They know how to behave.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.02,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Get off.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.19,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to be attacked on the bus.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a sparing partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.84,0:07:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.44,0:07:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Conflict means an opening.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they see us?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.68,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's here.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.76,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we say we're just passing by?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.81,0:08:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can not.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.89,0:08:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to help you!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.00,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't buy this...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.92,0:08:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're having fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.56,0:08:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not both of them.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.12,0:09:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're equally strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.87,0:09:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts, Polao?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One is just brute force.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The other is weak and powerless.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.35,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about, old man?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.04,0:09:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You and him.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.83,0:09:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, dumb toad!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.54,0:09:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.20,0:09:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Axian.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.68,0:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.37,0:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cut me down...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.05,0:09:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.02,0:09:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut the space switch.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.91,0:09:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,'Return home'?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take a moment.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alert.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.70,0:09:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's no more business,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,may I leave now?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We came for the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.43,0:09:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to part with it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.85,0:09:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.45,0:09:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.01,0:09:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The prizes of vow quests can be robbed.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.69,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you knew about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.59,0:09:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.03,0:10:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You say the Sky Pearl you have is not from Laojun?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.98,0:10:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.19,0:10:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He really doesn't have the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.02,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So even you can be wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.45,0:10:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it must be at the girl or the cat, surprisingly.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was careless.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.15,0:10:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So may I leave now?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall keep us company for a few days.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have it wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.87,0:10:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell truth and lies apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless to try to deny.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave, you must defeat all of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.17,0:10:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.64,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't trouble you any longer...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't trouble us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.63,0:10:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But we may trouble you for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.06,0:10:45.48,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)\pos(1350,550)}Mission: Sky Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.04,0:10:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go forward and throw a grenade!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.58,0:10:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.24,0:10:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\pos(912,890)}Kitty Grenade
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.96,0:11:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\pos(912,890)}Kitty Grenade
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.84,0:11:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(904,896)}Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,See you out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.65,0:11:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,200)\fs60\pos(378,284)}Settings
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.31,0:11:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs60\pos(396,466)}Exit
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.10,0:11:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.21,0:11:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't this just come out yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.95,0:11:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.95,0:11:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pro after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.01,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.12,0:11:51.92,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.99,0:11:53.45,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Can I eat it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This spirit space is quite comfortable.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.47,0:12:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I be?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.62,0:12:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For your comrades.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.96,0:12:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense to worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.97,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But last time you beat us hard.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.43,0:12:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you guys are weak.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.87,0:12:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a wall here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.35,0:12:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Axian!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.97,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The space ends here!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.74,0:12:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It ends abruptly?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.73,0:12:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't help us.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.12,0:12:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't spirit spaces spherical?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.99,0:12:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only natural, complete spaces are.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.85,0:12:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're together in trouble now,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.74,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,will you tell me now why you came here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,'River Fu' Spirit Elixir.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.70,0:12:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The day after a stable state is reached,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.07,0:13:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,take one pill in the morning,\Nduring the day and at the evening,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are cured.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.24,0:13:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,P.S.!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.23,0:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Wuxian for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is written here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.78,0:13:11.45,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on dreaming, girl...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.77,0:13:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei can understand me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And Xiaohuang understands me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.94,0:13:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.91,0:13:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are acting so weird...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.37,0:13:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he understand a lot?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.58,0:13:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.88,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.17,0:13:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Say meow!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.79,0:13:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Convinced yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a difference.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.68,0:13:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.62,0:13:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.19,0:13:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be scared!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Convinced yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.96,0:13:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only he can understand me,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.42,0:13:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can understand him too.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.55,0:13:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.84,0:13:57.55,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.92,0:13:59.06,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You can tell her that we can communicate,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.06,0:13:59.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,but don't talk about spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.71,0:14:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's true...?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.15,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to test it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to an anime con tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai is the cutest.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, don't flatter me!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.02,0:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One more test!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You took Xiaohei to the bathroom,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.92,0:14:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but just stared at him and didn't say a word.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.70,0:14:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it now?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.79,0:14:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.15,0:14:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei also understands Bidiu.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.24,0:14:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He can translate for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.77,0:14:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang, you're useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei says Xiaohuang says he's hungry.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.29,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You little glutton...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.50,0:14:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.74,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it back, you're awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.17,0:14:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.38,0:14:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.43,0:14:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Moss, Axian and Tanjiu.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.13,0:14:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you three came for the Sky Pearl too?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.53,0:15:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad at us, Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.35,0:15:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be your lucky day.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You need it for cultivation?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.04,0:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit force is scarce today.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cultivation got much harder.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.09,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we left you alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.01,0:15:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at this time.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.74,0:15:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to trace those riding a vehicle.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.31,0:15:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You said earlier that if we can find it,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.45,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd give it to us, correct?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.26,0:15:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got no chance against you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want them to be safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.95,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.11,0:15:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a robbery be that civilized?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all well-mannered.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.03,0:15:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I've heard you call him Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.58,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.61,0:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But he is not Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.15,0:15:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said I was him.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.20,0:16:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.33,0:16:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So many people!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.89,0:16:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the biggest anime convention in town.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Xiaohei was interested in this.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.96,0:16:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare for a cat.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to stay there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:29.51,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,725)}Anime Convention
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.96,0:18:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sensed them.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.45,0:18:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This one, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.40,0:18:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your purchase!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.75,0:18:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you buy?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.97,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a small gift.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.30,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Handsome guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.94,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,"Gate of the Living" is now available at Sector B3.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.22,0:19:03.51,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,An ID is required to make a purchase.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.51,0:19:05.00,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Do not use another person's name.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go stand in line.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.64,0:19:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You go have fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.92,0:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.96,0:19:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't buy that.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.99,0:19:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet when I'm done.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to go alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.61,0:19:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Dad's here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Shan!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.79,0:19:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going now.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.86,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.90,0:19:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.52,0:19:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling better, kitten?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.84,0:19:22.57,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.58,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come back to the tower last time?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the past alone...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the topic?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,World politics.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.63,0:19:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shopping for Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.77,0:19:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do that too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.28,0:19:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence that we meet here!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.81,0:19:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard your voice, so I came here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.16,0:19:40.99,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You come here often?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.01,0:19:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.02,0:19:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can be myself here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You like conventions?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, can we make some pictures with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.94,0:19:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.11,0:19:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What character is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.45,0:19:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea, but he's so cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.82,0:19:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.95,0:19:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.87,0:19:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.41,0:20:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to disguise myself here.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.27,0:20:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was Tanjiu who created your copies.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.65,0:20:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Only your spirit parts are here right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our real bodies are in a safe place.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.62,0:20:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't get hurt even if our copies are destroyed.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.62,0:20:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if we don't get them back,\Nwe lose cultivation.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.07,0:20:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by your appearance,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.35,0:20:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you live among humans, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.66,0:20:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We even have jobs.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.09,0:20:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.70,0:20:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Manhua artists!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.18,0:20:27.97,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\an7\pos(1606,934)}They're late\Nwith manuscripts\Non cultivation days
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met a spirit who has such a job.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.27,0:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are in fact not Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.23,0:20:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.15,0:20:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask your family name?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.78,0:20:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Luo.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.65,0:20:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolverine?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.73,0:20:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.92,0:20:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.40,0:20:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we stay here forever?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.53,0:20:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.61,0:20:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you'd rather leave too.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.61,0:20:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have a plan.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.17,0:20:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If we join forces,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.49,0:20:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't defeat them,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.85,0:20:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's easy to escape.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.65,0:20:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These ones?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.51,0:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he'd like them?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like these two, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.19,0:21:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.56,0:21:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you take this to Laojun?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You bought it for him?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take it yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.22,0:21:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.35,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But Gen said the Blue Jade Disc can be used only once in a month.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take it to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.68,0:21:18.77,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Isn't it Laojun's personal creation?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.12,0:21:20.52,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,How come it can't be used more often?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.65,0:21:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Disc is a first-rate magic tool for fixed-point teleportation.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.92,0:21:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose the limit was set especially for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want me to visit more often?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.36,0:21:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.63,0:21:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should ask him next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.62,0:21:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.99,0:21:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your badges are packed.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.61,0:21:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.79,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite crowded...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.20,0:21:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until they come out?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.65,0:21:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.64,0:21:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.74,0:21:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you kept your promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.91,0:22:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it strange you can't see the other three?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.26,0:22:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.48,0:22:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your closed eyes must be a facade.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.45,0:22:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed you relied on spirit sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.46,0:22:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed they already left?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.58,0:22:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you can leave this spirit space.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.15,0:22:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.51,0:22:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are space type.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.15,0:22:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know we can't leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.62,0:22:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiuxian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.39,0:22:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here and keep watch.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.82,0:22:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call Polao in.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.66,0:22:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are all these humans doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.67,0:22:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's market day.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.80,0:22:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Polao.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.93,0:22:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in for a minute.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.87,0:22:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.48,0:22:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They are not here.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.76,0:22:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.68,0:22:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't possess such abilities.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.53,0:22:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, why would they have stayed for so long?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.23,0:23:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They are going to look for the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.43,0:23:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:32.38,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:32.38,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:37.12,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:37.12,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:41.82,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:41.82,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:48.02,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:48.02,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:54.17,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:54.17,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:58.97,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:58.97,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:03.65,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:03.65,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:10.17,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:10.17,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:21.49,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:21.49,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.49,0:24:26.91,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.49,0:24:26.91,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.91,0:24:31.95,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.91,0:24:31.95,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:43.18,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:43.18,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:48.73,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:48.73,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:55.57,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:55.57,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
